WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.609
Toad hurried back to Rat's house.

2
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.284
Rat was waiting for him.

3
00:00:21.285 --> 00:00:24.681
"They shot at me!" cried Toad.

4
00:00:24.682 --> 00:00:27.144
"I told you," said Rat.

5
00:00:27.145 --> 00:00:29.014
"It's no use."

6
00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:32.610
"What can we do?" asked Toad.

7
00:00:32.611 --> 00:00:35.816
"The ferrets guard the house," said Rat.

8
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:38.801
"They watch day and night.

9
00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:43.027
We must wait until we have a plan."

10
00:00:43.028 --> 00:00:48.243
But Toad did not wait.

11
00:00:48.244 --> 00:00:53.620
"I'll go in through the back," said Toad.

12
00:00:53.621 --> 00:00:57.810
He rowed Rat's boat to Toad Hall.

13
00:00:57.811 --> 00:01:01.473
Toad watched his house from the boat.

14
00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:05.200
"Everything looks quiet," Toad said.

15
00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:08.119
"I'll hide under the little bridge."

16
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:12.338
Toad paddled carefully to the bridge.

17
00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:17.000
"They can't see me here," he said.

18
00:01:17.001 --> 00:01:18.898
Crash!

19
00:01:18.899 --> 00:01:23.038
A huge stone dropped from above.

20
00:01:23.039 --> 00:01:26.067
It smashed the bottom of the boat.

21
00:01:26.068 --> 00:01:29.232
Water poured in.

22
00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:32.880
"Oh no!" cried Toad.

23
00:01:32.881 --> 00:01:35.955
"The boat is sinking!"

24
00:01:35.956 --> 00:01:40.537
Toad sank with the boat into the river.

25
00:01:40.538 --> 00:01:44.950
Two weasels laughed from the bridge.

26
00:01:44.951 --> 00:01:50.278
"Don't come back!" they yelled.

27
00:01:50.279 --> 00:01:53.208
"We'll drop the next one on your head!"

28
00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:56.735
Toad climbed onto the shore.

29
00:01:56.736 --> 00:02:01.878
He walked sadly back to Rat's house.

30
00:02:01.879 --> 00:02:06.201
"I warned you!" said Rat angrily.

31
00:02:06.202 --> 00:02:09.277
"Now my boat is gone!

32
00:02:09.278 --> 00:02:13.468
The clothes I gave you are ruined!"

33
00:02:13.469 --> 00:02:18.549
Toad sat and put his head in his hands.
